#: rkward/agents/rkeditobjectagent.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The object '%1', could not be opened for editing. Either it does not exist, "
"or RKWard does not support editing this type of object, yet."
msgstr "Objekt „%1” nije moguće otvoriti za uređivanje. Ili ne postoji ili RKWard još ne podržava uređivanje te vrste objekta."

#: rkward/agents/rkeditobjectagent.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid "Cannot edit '%1'"
msgstr "Nije moguće urediti „%1”"

#: rkward/agents/rkloadagent.cpp:32
#, kde-format
msgid "Loading Workspace..."
msgstr "Učitavanje radnog prostora..."

#: rkward/agents/rkloadagent.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There has been an error opening file '%1':\n"
"%2"
msgstr "Došlo je do pogreške pri otvaranju datoteke „%1”:\n"
"%2"

#: rkward/agents/rkloadagent.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Error loading workspace"
msgstr "Pogreška pri učitavanju radnog prostora"

#: rkward/agents/rkprintagent.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"No service was found to provide a KDE print dialog for PostScript files. We "
"will try to open a generic PostScript viewer (if any), instead."
"<br><br>Consider installing 'okular', or configure RKWard not to attempt to "
"print using a KDE print dialog."
msgstr "Nije pronađena usluga koja pruža KDE-ov dijalog za ispis PostScript datoteka. Umjesto toga pokušat ćemo otvoriti generički preglednik PostScripta (ako je dostupan)."
"<br><br>Razmotrite instalaciju programa „okular” ili postavite RKWard tako da ne pokušava ispisivati pomoću KDE-ova dijaloga za ispis."

#: rkward/agents/rkprintagent.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid "Unable to open KDE print dialog"
msgstr "Nije moguće otvoriti KDE-ov dijalog za ispis"

#: rkward/agents/rkquitagent.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Waiting for remaining R commands to finish. To quit immediately, press "
"Cancel (WARNING: This may result in loss of data)"
msgstr "Čeka se dovršetak preostalih naredbi R-a. Za trenutačni izlaz pritisnite „Odustani” (UPOZORENJE: to može uzrokovati gubitak podataka)."

#: rkward/agents/rkquitagent.cpp:30
#, kde-format
msgid "Waiting for R to finish"
msgstr "Čeka se dovršetak rada R-a"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:49
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A file named \"%1\" already exists. Are you sure you want to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Datoteka naziva „%1” već postoji. Želite li je zaista prebrisati?"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A file named \"%1\" already exists, and will be overwritten when saving to "
"\"%2\". Are you sure you want to overwrite it?"
msgstr "Datoteka naziva „%1” već postoji i bit će prebrisana pri spremanju u „%2”. Želite li je zaista prebrisati?"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:53
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Files named \"%1\" and \"%2\" already exist, and will both be overwritten. "
"Are you sure you want to overwrite them?"
msgstr "Datoteke naziva „%1” i „%2” već postoje i obje će biti prebrisane. Želite li ih zaista prebrisati?"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:56
#, kde-format
msgid "Overwrite File?"
msgstr "Prebrisati datoteku?"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:63 rkward/rkward.cpp:907
#, kde-format
msgid "R Workspace Files [%1](%1);;All files [*](*)"
msgstr "Datoteke radnog prostora R-a [%1](%1);;Sve datoteke [*](*)"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Workspace is being saved. <b>Hint:</b> Should this take an unusually long "
"time, on a regular sized workspace, this may be due to other commands still "
"pending completion in the R backend."
msgstr "Radni se prostor sprema. <b>Savjet:</b> Ako to na radnom prostoru uobičajene veličine traje neuobičajeno dugo, razlog mogu biti druge naredbe koje još čekaju dovršetak u pozadinskom procesu R-a."

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid "Saving workspace"
msgstr "Spremanje radnog prostora"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid "Save failed"
msgstr "Spremanje nije uspjelo"

#: rkward/agents/rksaveagent.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"An error occurred while trying to save the workspace. You data was <b>not</"
"b> saved."
msgstr "Pri spremanju radnog prostora došlo je do pogreške. Vaši podaci <b>nisu</b> spremljeni."

#: rkward/agents/showedittextfileagent.cpp:30
#: rkward/misc/rkprogresscontrol.cpp:337 rkward/plugin/rkstandardcomponentgui.cpp:586
#, kde-format
msgid "Done"
msgstr "Gotovo"

#: rkward/agents/showedittextfileagent.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A command running in the R-engine wants you to see the following file(s):"
"<ul><li>"
msgstr "Naredba koja se izvodi u pogonu R-a želi da pogledate sljedeće datoteke:"
"<ul><li>"

#: rkward/agents/showedittextfileagent.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgid "Showing file(s)"
msgstr "Prikaz datoteka"

#: rkward/agents/showedittextfileagent.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A command running in the R-engine wants you to edit the following file(s). "
"Please look at these files, edit them as appropriate, and save them. When "
"done, press the \"Done\"-button, or close this dialog to resume.<ul><li>"
msgstr ""
"Naredba koja se izvodi u pogonu R-a želi da uredite sljedeće datoteke. "
"Pregledajte ih, po potrebi uredite i spremite. Kada završite, pritisnite "
"gumb „Gotovo” ili zatvorite ovaj dijalog za nastavak.<ul><li>"

#: rkward/agents/showedittextfileagent.cpp:85
#, kde-format
msgid "Edit file(s)"
msgstr "Uredi datoteke"

#: rkward/core/renvironmentobject.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This section contains data in your \"workspace\". This is data that you "
"created or imported, in contrast to data contained in a loaded R package. "
"Technically, this corresponds to the <i>.GlobalEnv</i> environment."
msgstr "Ovaj odjeljak sadrži podatke iz vašeg „radnog prostora”. To su podaci koje ste izradili ili uvezli, za razliku od podataka sadržanih u učitanom paketu R-a. Tehnički, to odgovara okruženju <i>.GlobalEnv</i>."

#: rkward/core/renvironmentobject.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your workspace contains more than 10.000 top level objects. RKWard is not "
"optimized for this situation, and you may experience lag between R commands. "
"Should this situation constitute a regular use case for your work, please "
"let us know at rkward@kde.org, so we can consider possible solutions."
msgstr "Vaš radni prostor sadrži više od 10.000 objekata najviše razine. RKWard nije optimiziran za takvu situaciju pa možete primijetiti zastoje između naredbi R-a. Ako je to uobičajen način rada, javite nam na rkward@kde.org kako bismo razmotrili moguća rješenja."

#: rkward/core/renvironmentobject.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgid "Many objects in workspace"
msgstr "Mnogo objekata u radnom prostoru"

#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The object '%1' was removed from workspace or changed to a different type of "
"object, but is currently opened for editing. Do you want to restore it?"
msgstr "Objekt „%1” uklonjen je iz radnog prostora ili je promijenjen u drugu vrstu objekta, no trenutačno je otvoren za uređivanje. Želite li ga vratiti?"

#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:59
#, kde-format
msgid "Restore object?"
msgstr "Vratiti objekt?"

#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:75
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to remove the object '%1'? The object is currently opened "
"for editing, it will be removed in the editor, too. There's no way to get it "
"back."
msgstr "Želite li zaista ukloniti objekt „%1”? Objekt je trenutačno otvoren za uređivanje pa će biti uklonjen i iz uređivača. Nećete ga moći vratiti."

#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:75
#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid "Remove object?"
msgstr "Ukloniti objekt?"

#: rkward/core/rkmodificationtracker.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you really want to remove the object '%1'? There's no way to get it back."
msgstr "Želite li zaista ukloniti objekt „%1”? Nećete ga moći vratiti."

