#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:42
#, kde-format
msgid "Reporting bugs in RKWard"
msgstr "Prijavljivanje grešaka u RKWardu"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>Where should I report bugs or wishes?</b></p><p>Thank you for taking "
"the time to help improve RKWard. To help us handle your request, "
"efficiently, please submit your bug reports or wishes in the <a href="
"\"%1\">KDE bugtracking system</a>. Note that you need a user account for "
"this, so that we will be able to contact you, for follow-up questions. <b>If "
"you do not have an account, please <a href=\"%2\">create one</a>, first.</"
"b></p><p>In case this is not possible for some reason, refer to <a href="
"\"%3\">%3</a> for alternative ways of reporting issues.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Gdje mogu prijaviti greške ili želje?</b></p><p>Hvala vam što "
"izdvajate vrijeme za poboljšanje RKWarda. Kako bismo učinkovito obradili "
"vaš zahtjev, prijavite grešku ili želju u <a href=\"%1\">KDE-ov sustav za "
"praćenje grešaka</a>. Za to vam je potreban korisnički račun kako bismo vas "
"mogli kontaktirati radi dodatnih pitanja. <b>Ako nemate račun, najprije <a "
"href=\"%2\">izradite ga</a>.</b></p><p>Ako to iz nekog razloga nije moguće, "
"pogledajte <a href=\"%3\">%3</a> za druge načine prijave problema.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p><b>What information should I provide, and how?</b></p>Clicking \"Report "
"issue\" will take you to the KDE bugtracking system. After logging in, some "
"information will already be pre-filled into the report form. Please make "
"sure to fill in the missing bits - in English - where indicated, especially "
"in the \"Comment\" field.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Koje podatke trebam navesti i kako?</b></p>Klikom na „Prijavi problem” "
"otvorit će se KDE-ov sustav za praćenje grešaka. Nakon prijave neki će "
"podaci već biti uneseni u obrazac. Obavezno popunite prazna polja — na "
"engleskom jeziku — osobito polje „Komentar”.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:57
#, kde-format
msgid "Report issue"
msgstr "Prijavi problem"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid "Forwarding you to the KDE bugtracking system"
msgstr "Preusmjeravanje na KDE-ov sustav za praćenje grešaka"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:73
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You are now being forwarded to the KDE bugtracking system. Should you "
"continue to see this page for more than a few seconds (e.g. if JavaScript is "
"disabled), please click \"Proceed\", below."
msgstr ""
"Sada ćete biti preusmjereni na KDE-ov sustav za praćenje grešaka. Ako se "
"ova stranica prikazuje dulje od nekoliko sekundi (primjerice ako je "
"JavaScript isključen), kliknite „Nastavi” u nastavku."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Proceed"
msgstr "Nastavi"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:103
#, kde-format
msgid "Show Details"
msgstr "Prikaži pojedinosti"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:105
#, kde-format
msgid "Report As Bug"
msgstr "Prijavi kao grešku"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:115
#, kde-format
msgid "Message code: %1\n"
msgstr "Kod poruke: %1\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:124
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"---Problem description---\n"
"Please fill in the missing bits *in English*.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"---Opis problema---\n"
"Nedostajuće podatke unesite *na engleskom jeziku*.\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:126
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Please give a brief summary on the problem:\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ukratko opišite problem:\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:129
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"I encountered the error message quoted below. Additionally, I saw the "
"following symptoms:\n"
"###Please fill in (if applicable)###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Prikazala mi se poruka o grešci navedena u nastavku. Osim toga, primijetio/la "
"sam sljedeće simptome:\n"
"###Please fill in (if applicable)###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:131
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"What - in detail - did you do directly before you encountered this problem?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Što ste točno učinili neposredno prije pojave ovog problema?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:132
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"When you try to repeat the above, does the problem occur again (no, "
"sometimes, always)?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ponavlja li se problem kada pokušate ponovno učiniti navedeno (ne, ponekad, "
"uvijek)?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:134
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If applicable: When doing the same thing in an R session outside of RKWard, "
"do you see the same problem?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Ako je primjenjivo: pojavljuje li se isti problem kada isto učinite u sesiji "
"R-a izvan RKWarda?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Do you have any further information that might help us to track this problem "
"down? In particular, if applicable, can you provide sample data and sample R "
"code to reproduce this problem?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Imate li dodatne podatke koji bi nam pomogli pronaći uzrok problema? "
"Možete li, osobito ako je primjenjivo, navesti primjer podataka i koda R-a "
"kojim se problem može ponoviti?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:139
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard is available in many different packagings, and sometimes problems are "
"specific to one method of installation. How did you install RKWard (which "
"file(s) did you download)?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"RKWard je dostupan u različitim paketima, a neki se problemi mogu odnositi "
"samo na određeni način instalacije. Kako ste instalirali RKWard (koje ste "
"datoteke preuzeli)?\n"
"###Please fill in###\n"
"\n"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:153
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Please stand by while gathering some information on your setup.\n"
"In case the backend has died or hung up, you may want to press 'Cancel' to "
"skip this step."
msgstr ""
"Pričekajte dok prikupljamo informacije o vašem sustavu.\n"
"Ako se pozadinski proces srušio ili prestao reagirati, pritisnite „Odustani” "
"da biste preskočili ovaj korak."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkerrordialog.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid "Gathering setup information"
msgstr "Prikupljanje informacija o sustavu"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:27
#, kde-format
msgid "Import Data Assistant"
msgstr "Pomoćnik za uvoz podataka"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:52
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For certain formats, RKWard provides specialized import dialogs, and those "
"generally provide the most options. Is the file you wish to import in one of "
"the following formats?"
msgstr ""
"Za neke formate RKWard nudi posebne dijaloge za uvoz, koji obično pružaju "
"najviše mogućnosti. Je li datoteka koju želite uvesti u jednom od sljedećih "
"formata?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:54
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"RKWard comes with several import dialogs, but none seem to be loaded, at "
"present. Check your settings."
msgstr ""
"RKWard dolazi s nekoliko dijaloga za uvoz, no čini se da trenutačno nijedan "
"nije učitan. Provjerite postavke."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:65
#, kde-format
msgid "None of the above / try another method"
msgstr "Ništa od navedenog / isprobaj drugi način"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:68
#, kde-format
msgid "Select format"
msgstr "Odaberi format"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:72
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The 'rio' package offers generic support for importing many different file "
"formats, but requires a number of additional R packages to be installed (you "
"will be prompted for missing packages). Do you want to give that a try?"
msgstr ""
"Paket „rio” nudi opću podršku za uvoz brojnih različitih formata datoteka, "
"ali zahtijeva instalaciju dodatnih paketa za R (bit ćete upitani za pakete "
"koji nedostaju). Želite li ga isprobati?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:74
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The generic import plugin (shipped with RKWard) is not presently loaded. "
"Check your settings."
msgstr ""
"Opći dodatak za uvoz (isporučen s RKWardom) trenutačno nije učitan. "
"Provjerite postavke."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid "Use 'rio'-based importer"
msgstr "Koristi uvoznik temeljen na paketu „rio”"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:83 rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:95
#, kde-format
msgid "Try another method"
msgstr "Isprobaj drugi način"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:86
#, kde-format
msgid "Generic 'rio'-based importer"
msgstr "Općeniti uvoznik temeljen na paketu „rio”"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:90
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If your data is moderate in size, and you can open/view it in another "
"application on your system, importing it from clipboard (copy and paste) may "
"be viable."
msgstr ""
"Ako vaši podaci nisu preveliki i možete ih otvoriti ili pregledati u drugoj "
"aplikaciji na sustavu, možda ih možete uvesti iz međuspremnika (kopiranjem "
"i lijepljenjem)."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:94 rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid "Import from clipboard"
msgstr "Uvezi iz međuspremnika"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<b>Ready to go</b><p>Click \"Finish\" to start the selected import dialog, "
"or \"Back\" to explore other options.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Sve je spremno</b><p>Kliknite „Završi” da biste pokrenuli odabrani "
"dijalog za uvoz ili „Natrag” da biste istražili druge mogućnosti.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:104
#, kde-format
msgid "Start import dialog"
msgstr "Pokreni dijalog za uvoz"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:108
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"No further import methods are available at this time. Things you can try, "
"include: <ul><li>Check for the availability of additional import plugins</"
"li><li>Save your data to a different format in the original application</"
"li><li>Ask for advice on rkward@kde.org</li></ul>"
msgstr ""
"Trenutačno nisu dostupni drugi načini uvoza. Možete pokušati sljedeće: "
"<ul><li>provjeriti jesu li dostupni dodatni dodaci za uvoz</li><li>spremiti "
"podatke u drugom formatu u izvornoj aplikaciji</li><li>zatražiti savjet na "
"rkward@kde.org</li></ul>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkimportdialog.cpp:110
#, kde-format
msgid "No import method found"
msgstr "Nije pronađen način uvoza"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure Packages"
msgstr "Konfiguriranje paketa"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:58
#, kde-format
msgid "Load / Unload R packages"
msgstr "Učitaj / ukloni pakete R-a"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid "Install / Update / Remove R packages"
msgstr "Instaliraj / ažuriraj / ukloni pakete R-a"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:64
#, kde-format
msgid "Manage RKWard Plugins"
msgstr "Upravljanje dodacima za RKWard"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Closing will discard pending changes. Are you sure?"
msgstr "Zatvaranjem će se odbaciti promjene na čekanju. Želite li nastaviti?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid "Discard changes?"
msgstr "Odbaciti promjene?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Do no close"
msgstr "Nemoj zatvarati"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:167
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:174
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:205
#, kde-format
msgid "Package %1 at %2"
msgstr "Paket %1 u %2"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:180
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The following packages, which you have selected for removal, are essential "
"to the operation of RKWard, and will not be removed. If you are absolutely "
"sure, that you want to remove these packages, please do so on the R command "
"line."
msgstr ""
"Sljedeći paketi koje ste odabrali za uklanjanje nužni su za rad RKWarda i "
"neće biti uklonjeni. Ako ste potpuno sigurni da ih želite ukloniti, učinite "
"to u naredbenom retku R-a."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:180
#, kde-format
msgid "Not removing certain packages"
msgstr "Neki paketi neće biti uklonjeni"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:186
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your current user permissions do not allow removing the following packages. "
"These will be skipped."
msgstr ""
"Vaše trenutačne korisničke ovlasti ne dopuštaju uklanjanje sljedećih paketa. "
"Oni će biti preskočeni."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:186
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Insufficient user permissions"
msgstr "Nedovoljne korisničke ovlasti"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Your current user permissions do not allow removing the following packages. "
"Do you want to skip these packages, or do you want to proceed with "
"administrator privileges (you will be prompted for the password)?"
msgstr ""
"Vaše trenutačne korisničke ovlasti ne dopuštaju uklanjanje sljedećih paketa. "
"Želite li ih preskočiti ili nastaviti s administratorskim ovlastima (bit "
"ćete upitani za lozinku)?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Become root"
msgstr "Postani root"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:189
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Skip these packages"
msgstr "Preskoči ove pakete"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:211
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"You are about to remove the following packages. Are you sure you want to "
"proceed?"
msgstr "Uklonit ćete sljedeće pakete. Želite li nastaviti?"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:211
#, kde-format
msgid "About to remove packages"
msgstr "Uklanjanje paketa"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid "Please stand by while removing selected packages"
msgstr "Pričekajte dok uklanjamo odabrane pakete"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:214
#, kde-format
msgid "Removing packages"
msgstr "Uklanjanje paketa"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:241
#, kde-format
msgid "Selected library location not writable"
msgstr "Na odabranu lokaciju biblioteke nije moguće pisati"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:243
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The directory you have selected for installation (%1) is not writable "
"with your current user permissions.</p><p>Would you like to install to %2, "
"instead (you can also press \"Cancel\" and use the \"Configure Repositories"
"\"-button to set up a different directory)?</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>U odabrani direktorij za instalaciju (%1) ne možete pisati s trenutačnim "
"korisničkim ovlastima.</p><p>Želite li umjesto toga instalirati u %2? "
"Možete i kliknuti „Odustani” te gumbom „Konfiguriraj repozitorije” postaviti "
"drugi direktorij.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:249
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Alternatively, if you have access to an administrator account on this "
"machine, you can use that to install the package(s), or you could change the "
"permissions of '%1'. Sorry, automatic switching to Administrator is not yet "
"supported in RKWard on Windows.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako na ovom računalu imate pristup administratorskom računu, možete ga "
"upotrijebiti za instalaciju paketa ili promijeniti ovlasti za „%1”. "
"Automatsko prebacivanje na administratorski račun još nije podržano u "
"RKWardu za Windows.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:252
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:258
#, kde-format
msgid "Install to %1"
msgstr "Instaliraj u %1"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:256
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Alternatively, if you are the administrator of this machine, you can try "
"to install the packages as root (you'll be prompted for the root password).</"
"p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ako ste administrator ovog računala, možete pokušati instalirati pakete "
"kao root (bit ćete upitani za rootovu lozinku).</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:258
#, kde-format
msgid "Become root"
msgstr "Postani root"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid "Please stand by while installing selected packages"
msgstr "Pričekajte dok instaliramo odabrane pakete"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:276
#, kde-format
msgid "Installing packages"
msgstr "Instaliranje paketa"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:297
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Neither kdesu nor kdesudo could be found. To install as root, please install "
"one of these packages."
msgstr "Nije moguće pronaći ni kdesu ni kdesudo. Da biste instalirali kao root, instalirajte jedan od tih paketa."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:297
#, kde-format
msgid "kdesu not found"
msgstr "kdesu nije pronađen"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:359
#, kde-format
msgid "Installed packages"
msgstr "Instalirani paketi"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:361
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:965
#: rkward/settings/rksettingsmoduleplugins.cpp:525
#: rkward/windows/rkhelpsearchwindow.cpp:83
#: rkward/windows/rkhelpsearchwindow.cpp:328
#, kde-format
msgid "Title"
msgstr "Naslov"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:361
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:966
#, kde-format
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Inačica"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:361
#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:967
#, kde-format
msgid "Location"
msgstr "Lokacija"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:366
#, kde-format
msgid "Load"
msgstr "Učitaj"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:368
#, kde-format
msgid "Unload"
msgstr "Ukloni iz memorije"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:375
#, kde-format
msgid "Loaded packages"
msgstr "Učitani paketi"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:512
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"There has been an error while trying to load / unload packages. See "
"transcript below for details"
msgstr "Došlo je do pogreške pri učitavanju ili uklanjanju paketa iz memorije. Pojedinosti potražite u transkriptu u nastavku."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:589
#, kde-format
msgid "Select all updates"
msgstr "Odaberi sva ažuriranja"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:657
#, kde-format
msgid "Show only packages matching:"
msgstr "Prikaži samo pakete koji odgovaraju:"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:659
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>You can limit the packages displayed in the list to with names or titles "
"matching a filter string.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Popis možete ograničiti na pakete čiji se nazivi ili naslovi podudaraju s nizom filtra.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:663
#, kde-format
msgid "Show only packages providing RKWard dialogs"
msgstr "Prikaži samo pakete koji nude dijaloge za RKWard"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:664
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Some but not all R packages come with plugins for RKWard. That means they "
"provide a graphical user-interface in addition to R functions. Check this "
"box to show only such packages.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Neki paketi R-a sadrže dodatke za RKWard, odnosno uz funkcije R-a nude i grafičko korisničko sučelje. Označite ovu kućicu da biste prikazali samo takve pakete.</p>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:684
#, kde-format
msgid "Install packages to:"
msgstr "Instaliraj pakete u:"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:688
#, kde-format
msgid "Install suggested packages"
msgstr "Instaliraj predložene pakete"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:690
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Some packages \"suggest\" additional packages, which are not strictly "
"necessary for using that package, but which may provide additional related "
"functionality. Check this option to include such additional suggested "
"packages."
msgstr "Neki paketi „predlažu” dodatne pakete koji nisu nužni za njihovu upotrebu, ali mogu pružiti dodatne povezane mogućnosti. Označite ovu mogućnost da biste uključili predložene pakete."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:698
#, kde-format
msgid "Configure Repositories"
msgstr "Konfiguriraj repozitorije"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:700
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Many packages are available on CRAN (Comprehensive R Archive Network), and "
"other repositories.<br>Click this to add more sources."
msgstr "Mnogi su paketi dostupni na CRAN-u (Comprehensive R Archive Network) i drugim repozitorijima.<br>Kliknite ovdje da biste dodali druge izvore."

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:724
#, kde-format
msgid "<b>Install %1 packages (plus dependencies), remove %2 packages</b>"
msgstr "<b>Instaliraj %1 paketa (i njihove ovisnosti), ukloni %2 paketa</b>"

#: rkward/dialogs/rkloadlibsdialog.cpp:797
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The following package(s) requested by the backend have not been found in the "
"package repositories: \"%1\". Maybe the package name was mis-spelled. Or "
"maybe you need to add additional repositories via the \"Configure "
"Repositories\" button."
