#: rkward/rbackend/rkrbackend.cpp:1583
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"</p>\t- The 'rkward' R-library either could not be loaded at all, or not in "
"the correct version. This may lead to all sorts of errors, from single "
"missing features to complete failure to function. The most likely cause is "
"that the last installation did not place all files in the correct place. "
"However, in some cases, left-overs from a previous installation that was not "
"cleanly removed may be the cause.</p>\t\t<p><b>You should quit RKWard, now, "
"and fix your installation</b>. For help with that, see <a href=\"https://"
"rkward.kde.org/compiling\">https://rkward.kde.org/compiling</a>.</p>\n"
msgstr "</p>\t- Biblioteka R-a 'rkward' ili se uopće nije mogla učitati ili nije odgovarajuće verzije. To može uzrokovati razne pogreške, od nedostupnosti pojedinih funkcija do potpunog prestanka rada. Najvjerojatniji je uzrok to što pri posljednjoj instalaciji nisu sve datoteke smještene na ispravno mjesto. U nekim slučajevima uzrok mogu biti ostaci prethodne instalacije koja nije potpuno uklonjena.</p>\t\t<p><b>Sada biste trebali zatvoriti RKWard i popraviti instalaciju</b>. Pomoć potražite na stranici <a href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/compiling\">https://rkward.kde.org/compiling</a>.</p>\n"

#: rkward/rbackend/rkrbackend.cpp:1587
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>\t-There was a problem setting up the communication with R. Most likely "
"this indicates a broken installation.</p>\t\t<p><b>You should quit RKWard, "
"now, and fix your installation</b>. For help with that, see <a href="
"\"https://rkward.kde.org/compiling\">https://rkward.kde.org/compiling</a>.</"
"p></p>\n"
msgstr "<p>\t-Došlo je do problema pri postavljanju komunikacije s R-om. To najvjerojatnije upućuje na neispravnu instalaciju.</p>\t\t<p><b>Sada biste trebali zatvoriti RKWard i popraviti instalaciju</b>. Pomoć potražite na stranici <a href=\"https://rkward.kde.org/compiling\">https://rkward.kde.org/compiling</a>.</p></p>\n"

